msgid "PassWall Speed Test"
msgstr "PassWall 节点测速"

msgid "Schedules and runs a PassWall node-based Cloudflare IP test: latency screening first, then a real download test on the fastest candidates; the best IP is written back to the selected passwall nodes and other integrations"
msgstr "定时通过 PassWall 节点优选 Cloudflare IP：先做延迟初筛，再对最优候选做真实下载实测，把最优 IP 写回所选 passwall 节点及其它集成"

msgid "Plugin Settings"
msgstr "插件设置"

msgid "Time-boxed iterative test"
msgstr "限时迭代测速"

msgid "Run the test in time-boxed mode: each tested node runs its own independent loop until the duration elapses. After its first pass, a node only re-tests the IPs that passed its previous pass, so its candidate pool shrinks toward the most stable, lowest-latency IPs. Nothing is written to result.csv or passwall during the run; when the timer ends, each node's best remaining IP is written back. A node exits early once its pool converges to the download-test candidate count (download_test_count) — further passes cannot change the final download list; the threshold is 3 when the download test is off."
msgstr "计时模式：每个待测节点跑独立的收敛循环，直到累计时长达配置的时长——第 1 遍测完自己的候选后，此后每遍只测上一遍通过的 IP，候选池逐遍收敛到最稳定、延迟最低的 IP。运行期间不写 result.csv、不写回 passwall；计时结束后一次性把各节点剩余通过集中的最优 IP 写回。候选收敛到「每 worker 下载测速候选数」（download_test_count）即提前结束——再迭代也不会改变最终下载名单；下载实测关闭时该阈值为 3。"

msgid "Iterative test duration (minutes)"
msgstr "迭代测速时长（分钟）"

msgid "Total wall-clock budget for the iterative test. The run stops after the round that is in progress when the deadline passes."
msgstr "迭代测速的总时长预算。到达时限后，正在运行的一轮跑完即停，不再开始新一轮。"

msgid "Duration must be at least 1 minute when the iterative test is enabled"
msgstr "启用迭代测速时时长至少为 1 分钟"

msgid "Third Party Settings"
msgstr "第三方设置"

msgid "Basic Settings"
msgstr "基础设置"

msgid "Crontab Settings"
msgstr "计划任务设置"

msgid "Logs"
msgstr "日志"

msgid "Two-stage test through the selected passwall node(s): first probes every candidate Cloudflare IP via a local SOCKS and measures HTTP HEAD latency (<code>time_pretransfer</code>); then downloads a real file through up to 10 lowest-latency IPs of each worker to measure actual throughput. The best IP by download speed is written back to each passwall worker node (if every download test fails, the latency ranking is kept)."
msgstr "通过所选 passwall 节点做两阶段测速：先经本地 SOCKS 对全部候选 Cloudflare IP 做 HTTP HEAD 延迟探测（<code>time_pretransfer</code>），再对每个 worker 延迟最优的最多 10 个 IP 真实下载文件、测实际吞吐。按下载速度选出的最优 IP 写回每个 passwall worker 节点；若全部下载测试失败则保留延迟排序。"

msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "启用"

msgid "Enable scheduled task to test the selected IP list"
msgstr "启用计划任务测试所选 IP 列表"

msgid "Enable custom cron"
msgstr "启用自定义 Cron"

msgid "Custom Cron"
msgstr "自定义 Cron"

msgid "Example: 0 */3 * * *"
msgstr "例如: 0 */3 * * *"

msgid "Interval"
msgstr "间隔"

msgid "Every %d hour(s)"
msgstr "每 %d 小时"

