msgid "Enter a local file path, for example: /etc/passwall-speedtest/ip.txt"
msgstr "输入本地文件路径，例如：/etc/passwall-speedtest/ip.txt"

msgid "Scan all IPs in each /24"
msgstr "扫描每个 /24 中的全部 IP"

msgid "Only applies to custom IP lists. Disabled by default: one random IP per /24 is tested. Enable to test every IP in each /24 (slower)."
msgstr "仅对自定义 IP 列表生效。默认关闭：每个 /24 只随机测 1 个 IP。开启后会扫描每个 /24 中的全部 IP（更慢）。"

msgid "Custom IP list file is required when using Custom file"
msgstr "当 IP 列表来源使用自定义文件时，必须填写自定义 IP 列表文件"

msgid "Passwall node to test through (single-node fallback)"
msgstr "用于测速的 passwall 节点（单节点回退）"

msgid "Used only when no passwall workers are selected in the Third-Party tab. Select a CF-CDN-fronted passwall node (VLESS/VMess/Trojan/SS…). Its <em>address</em> will be cycled through candidate IPs and finally set to the fastest one. SOCKS-type nodes (e.g. a local load-balance entry) are listed but cannot be tested through — their <em>address</em> is the SOCKS server itself."
msgstr "仅在「第三方设置」里未选 passwall worker 时使用。选择一个 CF-CDN 前置的 passwall 节点（VLESS/VMess/Trojan/SS…），其 <em>address</em> 会被候选 IP 轮换，最终设为最快 IP。SOCKS 类型节点（例如本地负载均衡入口）仍会列出，但不能用于测速——它的 <em>address</em> 就是 SOCKS 服务器本身。"

msgid "Socks — cannot be tested through"
msgstr "Socks 类型，不能用于测速"

msgid "During a speed test, passwall's global node is temporarily switched to this stable node and restored afterwards, so your live traffic is unaffected by the tested nodes' <em>address</em> being rewritten. <strong>Required.</strong> Must NOT equal the tested node (single-node fallback) or any selected passwall worker node. If your current global node is a shunt (分流) node, its shunt rules are suspended for the duration of the test and all traffic goes through this stable node."
msgstr "测速期间 passwall 的全局节点会临时切到该稳定节点，测速结束后还原，使你的实流量不受被测节点 <em>address</em> 被改写的影响。<strong>必填。</strong>不得与被测节点（单节点回退）或任何已选 passwall worker 节点相同。若你当前的全局节点是分流（shunt）节点，测速期间其分流规则会暂停，全部流量走该稳定节点。"

msgid "Probe URL"
msgstr "探测 URL"

msgid "URL probed via the node's local SOCKS; only the HTTP HEAD latency is measured. generate_204 / connectivity-check endpoints are preferred."
msgstr "经节点本地 SOCKS 探测的 URL；只测 HTTP HEAD 延迟。建议用 generate_204 / 连通性检测端点。"

msgid "Max IPs to test"
msgstr "最大测速 IP 数"

msgid "This mode tests IPs through the node (~3-7s each). Cap the count to avoid long runs; use a smaller IP list or lower this value for faster results. With the online CM source the filtered candidate list may reach hundreds of IPs — raise this value (e.g. 100-300) or only the first N are tested."
msgstr "此模式经节点逐个测 IP（每个约 3-7 秒）。限制数量避免耗时过长；用更小的 IP 列表或更小的值以加快结果。使用在线 CM 源时，过滤后候选可能达数百个——请调大此值（如 100-300），否则只测前 N 个。"

msgid "Probe timeout (s)"
msgstr "探测超时 (秒)"

msgid "Per-IP curl <code>--max-time</code> in seconds."
msgstr "每个 IP 的 curl <code>--max-time</code>，单位秒。"

msgid "Probes per IP"
msgstr "每 IP 探测次数"

msgid "How many curl probes per candidate IP. Each probe is a full SOCKS+curl, so higher values are slower. If <strong>any</strong> single probe fails, that IP is discarded immediately and the remaining probes are skipped — only IPs that succeed on <em>all</em> probes are kept, so the best IP is a stable one."
msgstr "每个候选 IP 的 curl 探测次数。每次探测都是完整的 SOCKS+curl，次数越多越慢。<strong>任意一次</strong>探测失败该 IP 立即丢弃并跳过后续探测——只有<em>全部</em>探测都成功的 IP 才保留，确保选中的 IP 稳定。"

msgid "Max parallel workers"
msgstr "最大并发 worker"

msgid "Cap on concurrently running passwall workers (only relevant when passwall nodes are selected in the Third-Party tab). 0 means run all workers at once. Each worker runs its own SOCKS+curl chain, so high values need more RAM/CPU — keep ≤ node count and mind router limits."
msgstr "并发运行的 passwall worker 上限（仅在「第三方设置」里选了 passwall 节点时生效）。0 表示一次性跑全部 worker。每个 worker 跑自己的 SOCKS+curl 链路，并发越高越吃内存/CPU——建议 ≤ 节点数，注意路由器承受能力。"

msgid "Retest current best IPs"
msgstr "复测现有最优 IP"

msgid "Runs the test only on the IPs already in the current best list (result.csv) and each node's current address. The online IP list is NOT re-downloaded. One latency round + the download test by default; when the time-boxed iterative test is enabled, the same candidates go through each node's convergence loop until the duration elapses. The best IP is written back as usual."
msgstr "只对当前 Best IP 表（result.csv）里已有的 IP 和各节点当前 address 测速，不重新下载在线 IP 列表。默认做一轮延迟测速 + 下载实测；开启「限时迭代测速」时，同一批候选进入各节点的收敛循环直到时长结束。最优 IP 照常写回。"

msgid "A test is already running"
msgstr "已有测速在运行"

msgid "Real download speed test"
msgstr "真实下载测速"

msgid "After latency screening, download a real file through up to 10 lowest-latency IPs of each worker to measure actual throughput (MB/s). The final best IP is chosen by download speed; IPs whose download test fails are dropped. If every download test fails (e.g. the URL is unreachable through that node), the latency ranking is kept. Each download runs through the node's local SOCKS exactly like the latency probe, and the generated SOCKS config is verified to point at the candidate IP before it is accepted. Fast-death: a candidate that downloads less than 1 MB in the first 5 seconds is aborted and marked failed."
msgstr "延迟初筛后，经每个 worker 延迟最优的最多 10 个 IP 真实下载文件，测实际吞吐（MB/s）。最终按下载速度选最优；下载测试失败的 IP 剔除。若全部下载测试失败（例如测试 URL 经该节点不可达），保留延迟排序。每次下载与延迟探测一样走节点本地 SOCKS，并在接受速度前校验生成的 SOCKS 配置确实指向该候选 IP。快速死亡：起测 5 秒内下载不足 1 MB 的候选会被立即中止并判失败。"

msgid "Download-test candidates per worker"
msgstr "每 worker 下载测速候选数"

msgid "Only the N lowest-latency IPs of each worker are download-tested (default 5, max 10). Each candidate downloads the file below (10 MB by default), so keep it small to limit proxy traffic and runtime."
msgstr "只对每个 worker 延迟最优的前 N 个 IP 做下载实测（默认 5，最多 10）。每个候选都会下载下面的文件（默认 10 MB），数量越小越省代理流量、耗时越短。"

msgid "At most 10 IPs can be download-tested per worker"
msgstr "每个 worker 最多只能对 10 个 IP 做下载测速"

msgid "Download test URL"
msgstr "下载测速 URL"

msgid "A fixed-size file downloaded through the node's local SOCKS. Cloudflare's speed endpoint works best for CF-fronted nodes. The response must be HTTP 2xx with at least 16 KB."
msgstr "经节点本地 SOCKS 下载的固定大小文件。对 CF 前置节点，Cloudflare 的测速端点效果最好。响应必须是 HTTP 2xx 且至少收到 16 KB。"

msgid "Cloudflare 10 MB"
msgstr "Cloudflare 10 MB"

msgid "Cloudflare 20 MB"
msgstr "Cloudflare 20 MB"

msgid "Download test time limit (s)"
msgstr "下载测速单 IP 时限（秒）"

msgid "Per-IP curl <code>--max-time</code> for the download test. A partial transfer cut off by this limit still yields a valid average speed. Fast-death: if less than 1 MB is downloaded in the first 5 seconds, the candidate is aborted immediately and marked failed."
msgstr "下载测速时每个 IP 的 curl <code>--max-time</code>。被该时限截断的部分下载仍会按已下载字节算出有效平均速度。快速死亡：起测 5 秒内下载不足 1 MB 的候选会被立即中止并判失败。"

msgid "Download speed"
msgstr "下载速度"

